rset 3 for mask attack, referenced as ?3\n\n  -4, --customCharset4 <customCharset4>\n          custom charset 4 for mask attack, referenced as ?4\n\n  -h, --help\n          Print help (see a summary with '-h')\n\n  -V, --version\n          Print version\n",
